{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026rjDQ1Gabxd1793156299.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>2026年香港小姐亞軍鄧匡閔日前首度踏足沙田馬場出席公開活動。首次親臨馬場的她，深刻感受到現場的熱鬧氣氛，事後更在社交平台分享多張精緻的打卡美照與粉絲互動，並興奮地留言寫道：「這也是我第一次來到沙田馬場，現場氣氛真的非常熱鬧、星光熠熠！」</p><p></p><p>從曝光的相片中可見，鄧匡閔當日精心打扮，身穿一襲粉紫色抹胸長裙晚裝，搭配同色系的華麗禮帽，並佩戴了閃亮的金飾珠寶亮相。晚裝的平口剪裁，大方展現出標緻的「直角肩」與迷人鎖骨，散發出優雅大方的氣質，氣場十足，瞬間成為全場矚目的焦點。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d5247d7f-00c4-412c-b9d8-6ef5743cddb3.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026XIATBytrCV1793156299.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f5c97bc4-3592-465b-a379-1c28006f8b52.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20262SJrYNVOJM1793156298.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>對於這次難得的馬場體驗，鄧匡閔難掩雀躍之情，她更感性地表示：「戴上閃亮的首飾走在馬場裡，心情都變得特別好了！」字裏行間充分流露出她對是次盛會的滿滿喜悅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:06.924539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.387271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:19.749222+00:00","content_hash":"f74ebc256b4442464058a92f9c72dd19cdfc221fd7a619c717e4670ae9b1e544","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:06.924539+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}